'''Xalx''' is an [[NPC]] that can be found in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}} in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}. They grant the player {{Item|Mysterious Meat}}, as well granting {{Item|Mysterious Crop}} as a visitor in {{Zone|The Garden}}.

