== Trivia ==
*'''Xalx'''{{'}}s skin is a slightly modified {{MobSprite|Goblin}} skin.
*The use of '''Xalx'''{{'}}s {{Item|Mysterious Meat}} is currently unknown.
*'''Xalx''' could be a reference to [[fandom:genshin-impact:Xiangling|Xiangling in Genshin Impact]]. Xiangling is a chef with similar dialogue to '''Xalx'''. The use of the term "traveler" in the dialogue is common in both characters.

